  {"id":"marker-sidi-driss","kind":"marker","at":[103.7,-123.8],"src":"plan:galaxytours-hotel-sidi-idriss#coordinate-pit-2","ev":"documented","conf":0.4,"name":"Hotel Sidi Driss, pit 2 · published coordinate, +-25 m","title":"Hotel Sidi Driss (pit 2) · published coordinate","text":"Galaxy Tours (MAT-04) gives 33.542564 N, 9.967038 E for pit 2 of Hotel Sidi Idriss: the dining-room set of the Lars homestead, filmed on 1 April 1976. The hotel has five pits joined by four lateral tunnels (built about 1967-68) and its main entrance is a surface-level passage to the middle pit. The coordinate lies 26 m from the nearest mapped rim (pit-w186702924); accuracy of the published point is not stated."}
